WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.503
"I'm tall."

2
00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:09.758
"I'm taller than you."

3
00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.713
"But I'm the tallest.

4
00:00:11.714 --> 00:00:14.981
I'm the best!"

5
00:00:14.982 --> 00:00:17.948
"But I'm pretty."

6
00:00:17.949 --> 00:00:21.459
"I'm prettier than you."

7
00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.258
"I'm the prettiest.

8
00:00:23.259 --> 00:00:26.941
I'm the best!"

9
00:00:26.942 --> 00:00:29.667
"I'm yellow."

10
00:00:29.668 --> 00:00:32.332
"I'm green."

11
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:34.653
"I'm yellow and green.

12
00:00:34.654 --> 00:00:43.257
I'm the best!"

13
00:00:43.258 --> 00:00:47.461
"Ha-ha! Now I can't hear the sunflower."

14
00:00:47.462 --> 00:00:50.954
"I can't hear her either!"

15
00:00:50.955 --> 00:00:53.853
"She made me feel bad."

16
00:00:53.854 --> 00:00:57.298
"I felt worse!"

17
00:00:57.299 --> 00:00:59.830
"I'm sorry."

18
00:00:59.831 --> 00:01:02.918
"That's okay."

19
00:01:02.919 --> 00:01:07.760
"By the way, you taste sweeter than me."

20
00:01:07.761 --> 00:01:11.486
"Thank you. You taste cooler than me."

21
00:01:11.487 --> 00:01:17.256
"Thanks. Hey! Let's be friends."

22
00:01:17.257 --> 00:01:22.538
"What a good idea!"

